text: >-
  Shadow of Ezra

  @ShadowofEzra • 3h

  FBI Director Kash Patel was questioned about whether George Zinn was

  part of a scheme to create distractions so the real killer of Charlie Kirk
  could

  slip away.

  Patel responded that some individuals were making "false claims" about

  killing Kirk and had nothing to do with the crime.

  Zinn's past includes being a 9/11 eyewitness and threatening to bomb the

  Salt Lake City Marathon finish line in 2013.

  R: DNA FROM EVIDENCE MATCHES SUSPECT

  FOX NEWS ALERI
